docs {
  The model catalog, a workspace's model settings, and its own AI
  provider keys (bring your own key) with the policy governing them.

  Variables: `Model Catalog - List` stores `modelCatalogId` and
  `modelCatalogSlug`; `Provider Credentials - Create` stores
  `aiProviderCredentialId`.
}
